	<div class="row nest first last wide">
	
	<div class="inner col col6 first last ide643dae0-73ad-4063-94eb-58316b6d7873" style="" data-widgetcontainerid="e643dae0-73ad-4063-94eb-58316b6d7873">	
    <div data-widget-id="6afcc922-00cf-4e82-98ca-81f0a30f287c" data-widget-controller-path="/InfoAdvanced/Widget">





	<section id="divInfoAdv6afcc922-00cf-4e82-98ca-81f0a30f287c" class="widget widgetInfoAdvanced skin63 widgetOptionSet5 wide" data-modulewidgettype="infoAdv" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}' data-elementquerymatch='matchMultiColumn' data-elementqueryunmatch='unmatchMultiColumn' aria-labelledby="header6afcc922-00cf-4e82-98ca-81f0a30f287c">
			<header class="widgetHeader" id="header6afcc922-00cf-4e82-98ca-81f0a30f287c">
		<div class="">
					<h3 >Website Accessibility</h3>
								</div>
	</header>
	<div class="widgetBody  cpGrid cpGrid1 ">
		<div class="row  wide">
					<div class="col col1 first last">
						<ol class="pageStyles semanticList">

<li class="InfoAdvanced widgetItem fr-view">
	<style>
	.access-statement-clean {
		font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: #333;
		max-width: 850px;
	}

	.access-statement-clean h2 {
		font-size: 1.4em;
		margin: 1.5em 0 0.5em;
		color: #1f1f1f;
	}

	.access-statement-clean p {
		margin: 0 0 1em;
	}

	.access-statement-clean a {
		color: #2A525E !important;
		text-decoration: underline !important;
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.access-statement-clean a:hover,
	.access-statement-clean a:focus {
		text-decoration-thickness: 3px;
	}

	.access-statement-clean a:focus {
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #e6c200, 0 0 0 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9) !important;
		outline: 4px solid transparent !important;
		background-color: rgba(230, 194, 0, 0.1) !important;
		display: inline-block !important;
		position: relative;
		z-index: 10000;
	}

	.access-statement-clean ul {
		margin: 0 0 1.25em;
		padding-left: 1.5em;
	}

	.access-statement-clean li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
	}
</style><div class="access-statement-clean"><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">San Francisco Recreation and Parks is committed to ensuring that our digital services are accessible to all users, including people with disabilities.</span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">We strive to meet or exceed the requirements of the <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG21/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: 14px;">Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA</a> and the <a href="https://www.sf.gov/languageaccess" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: 14px;">San Francisco Language Access Ordinance</a>.</span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">If you encounter an accessibility barrier while using this website, please contact our Communications team at <a href="mailto:rpdinfo@sfgov.org" style="font-size: 14px;">rpdinfo@sfgov.org</a>.</span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">To help us respond as effectively as possible, please include:</span></p><ul><li style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">The web page address (URL) where you encountered the issue</li><li style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">A description of the problem</li><li style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">The assistive technology, browser, and device you were using, if applicable</li></ul><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">We will make every reasonable effort to address your concerns in a timely manner.</span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;">City employees and job applicants requiring accommodations should contact <a href="https://www.sf.gov/departments--human-resources" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: 14px;">Human Resources</a>.</span></p></div>
</li>						</ol>
					</div>
		</div>
	</div>
